(5632793, 818812, 64989, '<td valign="top">I really like the depth of the colors here.  I''m not usually a fan of a centered composition, but it seems to work here.</td>', 'I really like the depth of the colors here.  I''m not usually a fan of a centered composition, but it seems to work here.', '2009-09-02 14:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632798, 818581, 64989, '<td valign="top">Great light!  There are two things I would have tried to do pre-shot.  The first is to remove the bit of dead leaf and spider web.  The second would be to spray them with water, the droplets might have added to the fresh feeling the shot already has.  I really like it! 7</td>', 'Great light!  There are two things I would have tried to do pre-shot.  The first is to remove the bit of dead leaf and spider web.  The second would be to spray them with water, the droplets might have added to the fresh feeling the shot already has.  I really like it! 7', '2009-09-02 15:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632801, 818625, 64989, '<td valign="top">I think your photo could have been improved if the focus was sharper on the apple.  To me it looks like your fingers are in focus, and the stem is out of focus.</td>', 'I think your photo could have been improved if the focus was sharper on the apple.  To me it looks like your fingers are in focus, and the stem is out of focus.', '2009-09-02 15:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632805, 818827, 64989, '<td valign="top">Very Nice!  The light and color are wonderful.</td>', 'Very Nice!  The light and color are wonderful.', '2009-09-02 15:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632807, 818057, 64989, '<td valign="top">Great take on the theme!  The light on the front 2 chokes is a little harsh and flat, but extra points for working to put together an ALL veggie scene!</td>', 'Great take on the theme!  The light on the front 2 chokes is a little harsh and flat, but extra points for working to put together an ALL veggie scene!', '2009-09-02 15:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632809, 818628, 64989, '<td valign="top">Clever Idea!  I like the transparency of the fruit slices.</td>', 'Clever Idea!  I like the transparency of the fruit slices.', '2009-09-02 15:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632810, 817644, 64989, '<td valign="top">The edge of the grapefruit looks oversharpened, I can see a darker blue edge all around the fruit.</td>', 'The edge of the grapefruit looks oversharpened, I can see a darker blue edge all around the fruit.', '2009-09-02 15:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632814, 818702, 64989, '<td valign="top">Seems quite soft like there is some camera shake from hand-holding, and the composition isn''t great.  My suggestions - crop in real tight, leaving very little outside the bowl and eggs, and add light, especially sunlight to get your shutter speed up.  (Or shoot on a tripod)</td>', 'Seems quite soft like there is some camera shake from hand-holding, and the composition isn''t great.  My suggestions - crop in real tight, leaving very little outside the bowl and eggs, and add light, especially sunlight to get your shutter speed up.  (Or shoot on a tripod)', '2009-09-02 15:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5632816, 818684, 64989, '<td valign="top">I had that song in my head all of last week, and now it''s back again.  But really, its a great shot, one of my faves so far.</td>', 'I had that song in my head all of last week, and now it''s back again.  But really, its a great shot, one of my faves so far.', '2009-09-02 15:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
