(5632821, 818825, 64989, '<td valign="top">Color is a bit off.  A corrective balance of the colors would really do this wonders.  Looks yummy though!</td>', 'Color is a bit off.  A corrective balance of the colors would really do this wonders.  Looks yummy though!', '2009-09-02 15:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
