(5632831, 818666, 64989, '<td valign="top">The dirty background is very distracting.  The highlights of the petals are very blown out.  Taking your light source off-camera and changing the camera angle might hve improved this by an awful lot.</td>', 'The dirty background is very distracting.  The highlights of the petals are very blown out.  Taking your light source off-camera and changing the camera angle might hve improved this by an awful lot.', '2009-09-02 15:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
