(5633734, 818408, 30049, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh.  Getting a potential double-whammy on this one.  First, there''s no story or "tale" being told here.  Then secondly, the photo has a few issues.  The light is flat and needs more contrast, it''s soft on focus, and somewhat noisy.  Sorry...keep at it.  Ask some questions in the forums for feedback once the challenge is finished.</td>', 'Uh-oh.  Getting a potential double-whammy on this one.  First, there''s no story or "tale" being told here.  Then secondly, the photo has a few issues.  The light is flat and needs more contrast, it''s soft on focus, and somewhat noisy.  Sorry...keep at it.  Ask some questions in the forums for feedback once the challenge is finished.', '2009-09-02 23:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
