(5635217, 818057, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well, I must say first that I''m not crazy about this challenge, and wish I could take all my votes back! Too many 5s. However, this is one of my favorites because it''s bizarre. I like the leading line to the sun and the overall composition, particularly the artichoke in the far background. I''m not crazy about the direct flash as there is an odd disconnect of light and white balance. 6</td>', 'Well, I must say first that I''m not crazy about this challenge, and wish I could take all my votes back! Too many 5s. However, this is one of my favorites because it''s bizarre. I like the leading line to the sun and the overall composition, particularly the artichoke in the far background. I''m not crazy about the direct flash as there is an odd disconnect of light and white balance. 6', '2009-09-04 00:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
