(5636010, 818753, 102019, '<td valign="top">It''s very dark.  With the red and green apples, were you going for this muted approach on purpose?  I would have liked to see more intense or saturated colours and contrast between the reds and greens.  I also think using the rule of thirds would have made this a more successful image (having the tower built on the right hand side, for example).</td>', 'It''s very dark.  With the red and green apples, were you going for this muted approach on purpose?  I would have liked to see more intense or saturated colours and contrast between the reds and greens.  I also think using the rule of thirds would have made this a more successful image (having the tower built on the right hand side, for example).', '2009-09-04 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5636012, 818019, 102019, '<td valign="top">I was bothered by another image in this challenge that had a very dark background like this because I felt it was too much darkness, but I don''t get that feeling with this image.  I wonder why?  I think it might be because there isn''t as much separation between the non-black parts.  I like this image a lot.  The composition works nicely.</td>', 'I was bothered by another image in this challenge that had a very dark background like this because I felt it was too much darkness, but I don''t get that feeling with this image.  I wonder why?  I think it might be because there isn''t as much separation between the non-black parts.  I like this image a lot.  The composition works nicely.', '2009-09-04 15:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
