(5640524, 818750, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but snapshotty execution, I''m afraid. There is a lack of clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. (Some jpeg artifacts can also be seen in the eyes) Your file size of only 44k indicates a highly compressed image. Compression kills detail. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)</td>', 'Great idea, but snapshotty execution, I''m afraid. There is a lack of clarity to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. (Some jpeg artifacts can also be seen in the eyes) Your file size of only 44k indicates a highly compressed image. Compression kills detail. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)', '2009-09-08 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
