(5640536, 818408, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is an odd color cast over the whole image. Perhaps your white balance settings were off. Not really sure, but it does not look right.</td>', 'There is an odd color cast over the whole image. Perhaps your white balance settings were off. Not really sure, but it does not look right.', '2009-09-08 14:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5640537, 818668, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll have nightmares about this. Thanks a lot.</td>', 'I''ll have nightmares about this. Thanks a lot.', '2009-09-08 14:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5640543, 817262, 83313, '<td valign="top">A creative effort, but has a few serious issues, I''m afraid. Harsh forward facing onboard flash is the biggest problem. I prefer to just use ambient light in a situation like this. (Might need a tripod to compensate for a long shutter speed, however.) Composition and the location on your kitchen counter is not the best either. Perhaps setting this up as if it were a doll on a child''s bed might have worked. Sorry to have to be so harsh on something you clearly put thought and effort into.</td>', 'A creative effort, but has a few serious issues, I''m afraid. Harsh forward facing onboard flash is the biggest problem. I prefer to just use ambient light in a situation like this. (Might need a tripod to compensate for a long shutter speed, however.) Composition and the location on your kitchen counter is not the best either. Perhaps setting this up as if it were a doll on a child''s bed might have worked. Sorry to have to be so harsh on something you clearly put thought and effort into.', '2009-09-08 14:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5640544, 818827, 83313, '<td valign="top">A great shot of blueberries, but I don''t see it as a "scene". Perhaps my interpretation of the topic is too narrow.</td>', 'A great shot of blueberries, but I don''t see it as a "scene". Perhaps my interpretation of the topic is too narrow.', '2009-09-08 14:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5640547, 818684, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Incredibly detailed, with perfect color and light. I don''t see it as a "scene made with fruits or vegetables" however. Might be my own narrow interpretation of the topic, as I am seeing a lot of shots like this.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Incredibly detailed, with perfect color and light. I don''t see it as a "scene made with fruits or vegetables" however. Might be my own narrow interpretation of the topic, as I am seeing a lot of shots like this.', '2009-09-08 14:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5640644, 818019, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the color and the lighting. Very strong contrasts, almost a still life painting. One problem I had with voting this challenge, however, was the description "create <i>a scene</i> using only fruits and vegetables." My idea of a scene is something more than a still life, but I am seeing many straightforward food shots in this challenge, without what I consider to be a scene involving it. I have been giving such entries a 5. It may be my own interpretation that is faulty, so I will not give them a lowball vote, but I can''t give them the higher votes either. I was ready to put this entry in the same category, except that your title pointed out a fitting subtlety that I had not noticed right off, so it got a 6 from me.</td>', 'I like the color and the lighting. Very strong contrasts, almost a still life painting. One problem I had with voting this challenge, however, was the description "create a scene using only fruits and vegetables." My idea of a scene is something more than a still life, but I am seeing many straightforward food shots in this challenge, without what I consider to be a scene involving it. I have been giving such entries a 5. It may be my own interpretation that is faulty, so I will not give them a lowball vote, but I can''t give them the higher votes either. I was ready to put this entry in the same category, except that your title pointed out a fitting subtlety that I had not noticed right off, so it got a 6 from me.', '2009-09-08 16:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5640743, 818628, 103074, '<td valign="top">Love the idea</td>', 'Love the idea', '2009-09-08 18:51:55.000000', NULL, 1);
