(5641205, 818057, 79955, '<td valign="top">Another cool shot !!! Huge congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'Another cool shot !!! Huge congrats on the ribbon', '2009-09-09 01:06:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641209, 817776, 45475, '<td valign="top">Haha, super shot! Congrats on the yellow! How''s that for coincidence, lol. Your outtakes are just as good too. Awesome!</td>', 'Haha, super shot! Congrats on the yellow! How''s that for coincidence, lol. Your outtakes are just as good too. Awesome!', '2009-09-09 01:07:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641236, 818753, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had thought this was an intentional desaturation. the other aspects of the photo were done well enough that I was pretty sure you meant it to be that way. I suspected the look would not go over well. I gave it a 6, however.</td>', 'I had thought this was an intentional desaturation. the other aspects of the photo were done well enough that I was pretty sure you meant it to be that way. I suspected the look would not go over well. I gave it a 6, however.', '2009-09-09 01:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641245, 818702, 83313, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Blackbox:</b></div><hr/><i> The is an awesome photo. To me, it''s also the best ''Shoehorned'' photo of the challenge! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I knew someone would appreciate the effort!</td>', 'Originally posted by Blackbox: The is an awesome photo. To me, it''s also the best ''Shoehorned'' photo of the challenge!  I knew someone would appreciate the effort!', '2009-09-09 01:15:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641252, 818652, 17203, '<td valign="top">Disappointing finish. A great setup marred by soft focus and grain. Better lighting and maybe a radish "butterfly" or other focal point positioned toward the top might have made this a top 5 or ribbon.</td>', 'Disappointing finish. A great setup marred by soft focus and grain. Better lighting and maybe a radish "butterfly" or other focal point positioned toward the top might have made this a top 5 or ribbon.', '2009-09-09 01:17:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641268, 817776, 61084, '<td valign="top">Wow, looks like you''re on a roll lately. Great imaginative shot. Congrats!</td>', 'Wow, looks like you''re on a roll lately. Great imaginative shot. Congrats!', '2009-09-09 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641280, 818057, 63812, '<td valign="top">Felicitaciones, Andres! well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'Felicitaciones, Andres! well deserved ribbon!', '2009-09-09 01:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641282, 817834, 93565, '<td valign="top">This has a lot going for it. It''s a "built" shot, but has great creativity behind it and an interesting approach to the challenge. The lighting is good too, with the only room for improvement being a bit more light on the left most fish. Great job keeping the melon lurking. The strawberry teeth are perfect and add great color. I think you might strengthened this a bit in terms of composition if you had done an angled shot in landscape format and filled the frame more, with the fish leading to the right and the melon to the left emerging from the shadows. Great shot though.</td>', 'This has a lot going for it. It''s a "built" shot, but has great creativity behind it and an interesting approach to the challenge. The lighting is good too, with the only room for improvement being a bit more light on the left most fish. Great job keeping the melon lurking. The strawberry teeth are perfect and add great color. I think you might strengthened this a bit in terms of composition if you had done an angled shot in landscape format and filled the frame more, with the fish leading to the right and the melon to the left emerging from the shadows. Great shot though.', '2009-09-09 01:30:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641284, 818753, 99413, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> I had thought this was an intentional desaturation. the other aspects of the photo were done well enough that I was pretty sure you meant it to be that way. I suspected the look would not go over well. I gave it a 6, however. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yeah i was unsure, i wanted it almost completely desaturated with a slght duotone, and my friend though it looked good saturated. so i thought i''d compromise and slightly desaturate it ( because that sounds like such a grat idea right? lol) i regreted it almost right after i submitted it but it was too late because I submitted it last minute. <br/> <br/>Once i get a membership i''ll upload the one i liked to do it justice because i like the picture, just not colour. thanks for the comments though.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: I had thought this was an intentional desaturation. the other aspects of the photo were done well enough that I was pretty sure you meant it to be that way. I suspected the look would not go over well. I gave it a 6, however.   yeah i was unsure, i wanted it almost completely desaturated with a slght duotone, and my friend though it looked good saturated. so i thought i''d compromise and slightly desaturate it ( because that sounds like such a grat idea right? lol) i regreted it almost right after i submitted it but it was too late because I submitted it last minute.  Once i get a membership i''ll upload the one i liked to do it justice because i like the picture, just not colour. thanks for the comments though.', '2009-09-09 01:31:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641310, 818652, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is sort of a revelation.  Sitting here admiring your shot, wondering what I might say to show my appreciation of its fullness and richness and cunning, I noticed the comments and took another look.  Well, I totally missed the noise, but looking closer I see that all is not crisp and crystal clear as well.  Oh dear.</td>', 'This is sort of a revelation.  Sitting here admiring your shot, wondering what I might say to show my appreciation of its fullness and richness and cunning, I noticed the comments and took another look.  Well, I totally missed the noise, but looking closer I see that all is not crisp and crystal clear as well.  Oh dear.', '2009-09-09 01:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641318, 818769, 68504, '<td valign="top">Well observed.  (My tomatoes don''t get faces, just obscene protuberances).</td>', 'Well observed.  (My tomatoes don''t get faces, just obscene protuberances).', '2009-09-09 01:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641319, 818019, 105171, '<td valign="top">Beat two goals in one shot.  Thanks for all the nice comments.</td>', 'Beat two goals in one shot.  Thanks for all the nice comments.', '2009-09-09 01:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
